[V] — a vector
[X] — some value
[T] — a threshold

[!] — remember to validate [V] before shipping
[^] plain note

[!] — current threshold [T] is hard-coded
[^] note with a variable ref

[!] — /Process must run before /Aggregate
[^] note with a function ref

[!] — see step [3] for context
[^] note with a step ref

